"name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"i5oTNLL81YW4Y9-xdGb4xw","review_id":"yCaCvMfSGxn_GnVHvup8Qg","date":"2020-08-15T04:17:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.932673454284668,"text_excerpt":"I've been wanting to try this spot but they're only opened on weekends so I was finally able to go! There was a really long wait and we ended up eating outside after about an hour. There were no fans so it was HOT! But the server was so sweet and we found out she was actually one of the owners! This is a black owned mother and daughter business! So exciting! She was so attentive and really made a great impression! The food was delicious! I ordered the chicken and waffles twisted up with the banana caramel option! I also had the grits which were creamy and delicious. I will definitely be going back or even trying takeout! Support black business! My friend had the chicken and waffles with c..."},{"business_id":"i5oTNLL81YW4Y9-xdGb4xw","review_id":"hlLtgEf9XpQ9r_pciJ1DEw","date":"2021-05-28T20:41:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9219415783882141,"text_excerpt":"this is an amazing small black owned business in the downtown NOLA area--i came here on a friday afternoon for breakfast/brunch. we we're greeted quickly at the door and seated right away! staff is extremely friendly & gave a lot of good meal recommendations. a lot of their dishes are centered around waffles & different specials with assorted fruits. i decided to get the creole grits & those were hands down the best grits ever, not too rich & good portions of shrimp--it was perfectly seasoned and plated beautifully. was really impressed with how well the waffle biscuits tasted as well. my friend ordered the waffle bowl which had an amazing combination of flavors & was plated nice as well!..."},{"business_id":"i5oTNLL81YW4Y9-xdGb4xw","review_id":"kpt2gP2JzwqdlJlK9dbmZg","date":"2021-06-13T15:41:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9198534488677979,"text_excerpt":"Great food and experience. Love the place. Great for breakfast anytime. I highly recommend. We had waffle sandwiches, waffle bowls, and the turtle waffle. Grits were creamy."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"i5oTNLL81YW4Y9-xdGb4xw","photo_id":"SaWtJwjCPcn6A3yfvALvog","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/SaWtJwjCPcn6A3yfvALvog.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8594516515731812},{"business_id":"i5oTNLL81YW4Y9-xdGb4xw","photo_id":"usn9Qkn7OVAoHr0reae82g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/usn9Qkn7OVAoHr0reae82g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8048710227012634},{"business_id":"i5oTNLL81YW4Y9-xdGb4xw","photo_id":"VS08GS7xCNxaaXEcgWLi-w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/VS08GS7xCNxaaXEcgWLi-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.798639178276062},{"business_id":"i5oTNLL81YW4Y9-xdGb4xw","photo_id":"2eypskg2YxrtfKQ1wnXGQg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2eypskg2YxrtfKQ1wnXGQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7849404811859131},{"business_id":"i5oTNLL81YW4Y9-xdGb4xw","photo_id":"5GSdHsFns9o7QNLh8OlkDA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/5GSdHsFns9o7QNLh8OlkDA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7515568137168884}]},"notebook_case":null}
